# v6.0.0 — dev-only files excluded from public ship.
# These remain in the local working tree (untrack ≠ delete) but are not
# part of what users get on `npx skills add` or `git clone`. See v6.0.0
# CHANGELOG entry "Smaller install footprint" for rationale.
tests/*
